liens and calm your own brain at the same time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/extras/19c8df32ed1990539337fad2f6ae4be0.poster.avif?t=1766044995\" width=1000 height=613 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/extras/19c8df32ed1990539337fad2f6ae4be0.webm?t=1766044995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop from one odd and adorable planet to the next, each stranger and cuter than the last. Collect shiny stardust, uncover secret routes and meet Capie, the chill shopkeeper who sells very good caps. You never quite know if the next corner hides a new puzzle, a new cap or just a very silly photo opportunity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/extras/c61e4be86193b032bf16b4266684039c.poster.avif?t=1766044995\" width=1000 height=613 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358170/extras/c61e4be86193b032bf16b4266684039c.webm?t=1766044995\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodo wobbles, trips, and occasionally face-plants, but it never gives up on its chicken family. Underneath the clumsy feet is a very determined little heart. Ready to accompany this adorable little duckie? This adventure is full of quacks, caps, and chaos, so grab the hat and jump in. Your next adventure (and your next cute screenshot) is waiting.</p>","developers":["BornMonkie"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shar